userContent.text:
Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: For a single slit, the dark fringes occur at angles satisfying a·sinθ = mλ, so the geometric directions of the dashed rays coincide exactly with the zeros of the intensity pattern on the screen, and the angular spread of the pattern grows with λ/a.
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): The dashed rays and the zeros of the red curve are the same physics seen two ways — a·sinθ = mλ means the pattern's angular size is set entirely by the ratio λ/a.
DEMO STEPS: 6 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

